<!doctype html><html lang="en"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow"><title>Haphazard — Field Notes</title><style>
*{box-sizing:border-box}body{margin:0;background:#fff9e9;color:#152519;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;background-image:radial-gradient(#dccfb5 1px,transparent 1px);background-size:18px 18px}.wrap{width:min(1160px,calc(100% - 36px));margin:auto}header{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;padding:22px 0;font-weight:800}.logo{font-size:1.3rem;letter-spacing:-.05em}.logo span{background:#ff5b35;color:#fff;padding:2px 5px;transform:rotate(-2deg);display:inline-block}.nav{display:flex;gap:8px}.nav a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border:2px solid #17251b;border-radius:100px;padding:8px 12px;font-size:.75rem}.hero{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr .65fr;gap:60px;align-items:center;padding:60px 0 90px}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,9vw,8.8rem);line-height:.83;letter-spacing:-.085em;margin:0}.scribble{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:400;color:#ff5b35}.note{background:#ffe06a;padding:28px;box-shadow:8px 9px 0 #17251b;transform:rotate(2deg);font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.28rem;line-height:1.45;position:relative}.note:before{content:"NOTE TO SELF";display:block;font:900 .65rem Arial,sans-serif;letter-spacing:.18em;margin-bottom:18px}.note button{border:0;border-bottom:2px solid #17251b;background:transparent;font:800 .75rem Arial,sans-serif;cursor:pointer;padding:5px 0}.tape{position:absolute;background:rgba(220,205,168,.7);height:24px;width:110px;top:-12px;left:50%;transform:translateX(-50%) rotate(-4deg)}.marquee{overflow:hidden;background:#152519;color:#fff9e9;border-block:3px solid #152519;transform:rotate(-.5deg);width:100%;margin-left:0}.track{display:flex;gap:42px;white-space:nowrap;padding:13px 0;font-weight:900;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;animation:move 22s linear infinite}.track span{color:#ffb928}@keyframes move{to{transform:translateX(-50%)}}.projects{padding:100px 0}.projects-head{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.6fr 1fr;gap:30px;margin-bottom:40px}.projects-head p{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:1.35rem;max-width:38ch;margin:0}.eyebrow{font-weight:900;font-size:.7rem;letter-spacing:.17em;text-transform:uppercase}.cards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(12,1fr);gap:18px}.card{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;border:3px solid #152519;padding:24px;min-height:280px;position:relative;transition:.15s}.card:hover{transform:rotate(-1deg) translateY(-5px);box-shadow:7px 7px 0 #152519}.card:nth-child(1){grid-column:span 7;background:#9fe1c0}.card:nth-child(2){grid-column:span 5;background:#ff8a65}.card:nth-child(3){grid-column:span 5;background:#a9c8ff}.card:nth-child(4){grid-column:span 7;background:#ffe06a}.card small{font-weight:900;letter-spacing:.12em}.card h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,4rem);line-height:.9;letter-spacing:-.06em;margin:52px 0 14px}.card p{max-width:45ch;line-height:1.55}.card .go{position:absolute;right:20px;top:18px;border:2px solid #152519;border-radius:50%;width:40px;height:40px;display:grid;place-items:center;font-weight:900}.principles{border-top:3px solid #152519;border-bottom:3px solid #152519;display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr)}.principle{padding:44px;border-right:3px solid #152519}.principle:last-child{border:0}.principle b{font-family:Georgia,serif;font-size:2rem;display:block;margin-bottom:10px}.principle p{line-height:1.5}.footer{padding:35px 0 80px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-weight:800;font-size:.8rem}.chooser{position:fixed;left:16px;bottom:16px;background:#fff;border:3px solid #152519;padding:12px;z-index:4;box-shadow:4px 4px 0 #ff5b35;max-width:360px}.chooser label{font-weight:900;font-size:.66rem;letter-spacing:.12em}.chooser select{display:block;margin-top:7px;width:100%;border:0;background:#fff;font:700 .82rem Arial;padding:4px}@media(max-width:760px){.hero{grid-template-columns:1fr}.projects-head{grid-template-columns:1fr}.card:nth-child(n){grid-column:span 12}.principles{grid-template-columns:1fr}.principle{border-right:0;border-bottom:3px solid #152519}.nav a:first-child{display:none}.hero h1{font-size:clamp(4rem,19vw,6.5rem)}}
</style></head><body><header class="wrap"><div class="logo"><span>haphazard</span>.dev</div><nav class="nav"><a href="#projects">The things</a><a href="https://github.com/HaphazardDev">GitHub ↗</a></nav></header><main><section class="hero wrap"><h1>Software for the <span class="scribble">awkward</span> parts.</h1><aside class="note"><i class="tape"></i><p id="note-text">Most tools start with a grand vision. These start with “why is this still annoying?”</p><button id="shuffle">Another thought ↻</button></aside></section><div class="marquee"><div class="track">WORKTREES <span>✦</span> EDITORS <span>✦</span> TERMINALS <span>✦</span> CODING AGENTS <span>✦</span> SMALL SHARP TOOLS <span>✦</span> WORKTREES <span>✦</span> EDITORS <span>✦</span> TERMINALS <span>✦</span> CODING AGENTS <span>✦</span></div></div><section class="projects wrap" id="projects"><div class="projects-head"><span class="eyebrow">Things that escaped the workshop</span><p>Experiments and utilities built because a workflow had one too many papercuts.</p></div><div class="cards"><a class="card" href="https://arashi.haphazard.dev"><span class="go">↗</span><small>01 / WORKTREES</small><h2>Arashi</h2><p>For when “just open the other repo” stops being a reasonable development strategy.</p></a><a class="card" href="https://github.com/corwinm/oil.code"><span class="go">↗</span><small>02 / EDITOR</small><h2>oil.code</h2><p>Your filesystem is editable. Act accordingly.</p></a><a class="card" href="https://github.com/corwinm/coding-agents-tmux"><span class="go">↗</span><small>03 / AGENTS</small><h2>coding-agents-tmux</h2><p>Keep many coding agents close without opening many more windows.</p></a><a class="card" href="https://github.com/HaphazardDev/pi-extensions"><span class="go">↗</span><small>04 / EXPERIMENTS</small><h2>pi extensions</h2><p>Small modifications to a capable agent, each aimed at one daily irritation.</p></a></div></section><section class="principles"><div class="principle"><b>Start with friction.</b><p>A concrete annoyance is a better brief than a trend.</p></div><div class="principle"><b>Stay composable.</b><p>Fit the tools people already chose instead of replacing everything.</p></div><div class="principle"><b>Ship the useful bit.</b><p>Small, legible, and real beats impressive in theory.</p></div></section></main><footer class="footer wrap"><span>Made by Corwin Marsh</span><span>Haphazard on purpose.</span></footer><div class="chooser"><label for="line">TRY THE HERO AS</label><select id="line"><option value="awkward">Software for the awkward parts.</option><option value="rough">Better tools for the rough edges.</option><option value="itchy">Built for workflows that itch.</option><option value="haphazard">Haphazard on purpose.</option></select></div><script>const copy={awkward:['Software for the ','awkward',' parts.'],rough:['Better tools for the ','rough',' edges.'],itchy:['Built for workflows that ','itch','y.'],haphazard:['','Haphazard',' on purpose.']};document.querySelector('#line').onchange=e=>{const x=copy[e.target.value];document.querySelector('h1').innerHTML=x[0]+'<span class="scribble">'+x[1]+'</span>'+x[2]};const notes=['Most tools start with a grand vision. These start with “why is this still annoying?”','A good workflow tool should feel obvious a week later.','The experiment can be playful. The result still has to work.','There is usually leverage hiding in the seams.'];let n=0;document.querySelector('#shuffle').onclick=()=>{n=(n+1)%notes.length;document.querySelector('#note-text').textContent=notes[n]}</script></body></html>